WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:09.180
Though Western beauty standards may be taking the world by storm, they still aren't the norm everywhere.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:13.600
There are some cultures that take their beauty standards seriously, and sometimes it can seem a bit brutal.

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.960
If you are a first time viewer, click that red "Subscribe" button.

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:21.360
Prepare to be shocked with these 10 unusual women beauty standards around the world.

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:24.040
Double Tooth, Japan.

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:28.460
Most of the time when people have crooked teeth in western cultures, they pay thousands of dollars

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:33.760
to get them fixed. The exact opposite is true in Japan where women pay to have their teeth crooked.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:37.900
This beauty standard is known as "Yaeba", which translates into "double tooth" in Japanese.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:42.840
The trend started with Japanese pop stars, but women with crooked teeth had been thought to be alluring

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:44.600
in Japan for a while.

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:47.480
Long earlobes, Maasai tribes of Kenya.

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:51.820
The Maasai tribes of Kenya have been stretching their earlobes for centuries.

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:54.780
The older the person is, the longer their earlobes tend to be.

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:59.740
The Maasai women stretch their earlobes over time with various size horns, rocks, or sticks.

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:04.380
Once they are done with the stretching process, they decorate their earlobes with beading ornaments.

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:06.940
Stretched Lips, Southern Ethiopia.

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:10.420
When a girl is becoming a woman in the Southern Ethiopian tribe,

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:13.220
they will start the lip stretching, or lip plating process.

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:18.600
Over a period of time she and her family will keep stretching her lip until it is about 8 to 20 centimeters

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:24.200
in diameter. At that point, the woman will put a plate in her lip, which she takes great pride in decorating.

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:28.660
The process is also important, as it is a part of wedding rituals in their culture.

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:31.040
Elongated Necks, Thailand.

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:35.820
From the time they were four years old, the women of the Kayan tribe in Northern Thailand start putting

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:40.320
brass coils around their neck. As the woman ages, she gets more and more coils.

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:44.420
Eventually, the coils elongate their neck, which is considered beautiful in their culture.

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:48.380
Though it seems like they are growing long necks, it's actually the weight of the coils pushing

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:51.840
their shoulders down that gives the illusion of the desirable long necks.

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:54.040
Fat Farms, Mauritania.

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:58.340
In the Western cultured world, it's hard to believe that people would actually send their young daughter

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:03.380
to fat farms to pump them up. That is exactly what they do in Maurtinia where being curvy and having

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:05.380
stretch marks are most desirable.

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:10.240
Girls are sent to camps where they're force fed up to 16,000 calories a day, all for the sake

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:12.180
of being able to get married.

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:16.760
Red clay skin and hair, Himba people of Northern Namibia

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:21.340
The Himba people of Northern Hamibia slather themselves from head to toe in thick clay called

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:26.700
otjize. The otjize is made from ochre, fat and aromatic resin. When is applied to the hair and body

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:30.440
it turns everything an orange-ish red, which is supposed to symbolize blood.

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:34.860
To the Himba people, blood is the essence of life. While this is a beauty standard, it actually serves

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:38.760
a second purpose. The otjize also helps protect their skin from the sun and heat.

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:42.260
Scarification, Ethiopia's Karo tribe.

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:48.600
The ancient ritual of scarification in Ethiopia's Karo tribe seems a bit brutal, but is still practiced today.

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:53.040
It is a long  painful process that includes women cutting patterns into their faces and chests

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:55.360
with sharp objects like glass or knives.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:03:00.120
Once the wounds are open, the women rub charcoal or gun powder into the openings,

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:02.900
so that the wounds will form keloids once they heal.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:06.880
Over a period of time, women can add more and more scars to themselves.

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:11.600
They think of scars as art work and admit that the only reason that they still perform scarification

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.000
is to attract men.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.980
Face tattoos, Maori

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:20.140
The Maori of the indigenous Polynesian people of New Zealand have a rich and interesting culture.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:25.280
Maori men and women have been using face tattoos, or facial moko, to enhance beauty, show

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:28.260
social status, and show personality for centuries.

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:32.260
No two facial moko are alike, and women usually have a less extreme version than their

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:36.940
male counterparts. Maori women usually get facial moko on their chins and they believe

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:41.740
this defines and flatters the face, draws attention to the eyes, and can even correct facial flaws.

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:44.140
Surgical bandages, Iran.

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:48.680
When it comes to beauty standards around the world, most cultures agree that noses are important,

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:54.200
but none of them take it as far as women in Iran, which has now become the nose job capital of the world.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:59.620
Iranian women are born with what they believe are unflattering noses. So when women are old enough,

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:04.180
they get them fixed. To them, wearing their surgical bandages from their nose jobs are like wearing

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:08.660
a bandage of honor. Women believe in fake getting nose jobs, and wear fake surgical bandages

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:10.620
all for the sake of being desired.

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:12.680
Teeth filing, Indonesia

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:17.680
In Indonisia, it is customary for boys and girls to go through "metatah", or teeth filing.

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:22.360
By the time they hit puberty, this makes the teeth look elongated and sharp, and is considered

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:27.160
quite beautiful in their culture. The custom is said to help the soul remove sadistic urges

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:32.100
like jealousy and anger. While people don't have to get it done exactly at puberty, it is a custom

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:34.600
that must be done before someone can get married.

